graph TD
    A[Start] --> B[Setup Python Env]
    B --> C{Parallel Lint}
    C --> |Flake8| D[Run Flake8]
    C --> |Black| E[Run Black]
    D --> F[Security Scan]
    E --> F
    F --> G[Unit Tests]
    G --> H[Integration Tests]
    H --> I[SonarQube Analysis]
    I --> J[Build Package]
    J --> K{Main Branch?}
    K --> |Yes| L[Publish to PyPI]
    K --> |No| M[Skip Publish]
    L --> N[Cleanup]
    M --> N
    N --> O{Success?}
    O --> |No| P[Send Failure Email]
    O --> |Yes| Q[End]
    P --> Q
    
    style A fill:#90EE90
    style Q fill:#90EE90
    style P fill:#FFB6C1
